  "title": "dfilter: restore support for identifiers using hyphen",
  "description": "Restores support for filters such as \"mac-lte\", that was broken\nin 330d40832848411da3c3d2646978e41240bf848b.\n\nThis means we are not able to support arithmetic expressions with binary\nminus without spaces.\n\n```\n$ dftest 'tcp.port == 1-2'\ndftest: \"1-2\" is not a valid number.\n```",
